.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-migrate-workspace 1  "xil-migrate-workspace " 
.SH NAME
xil\-migrate\-workspace \- Migrate a pre\-0.1.8 workspace to the normalized directory layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-migrate\-workspace\fR [\fB\-\-workspace\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Migrate a pre\-0.1.8 workspace to the normalized directory layout
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-workspace\fR \fI<WORKSPACE>\fR [default: .]
Workspace root directory (default: current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview moves without touching files (default: enabled for safety)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
